\">\\n                        <div class=\\\"legend-color\\\" style=\\\"background: #fbbf24;\\\"></div>\\n                        <span>Leaves (brown)</span>\\n                    </div>\\n                </div>\",\"replace_all\":false}","result":"unknown","duration_ms":0}
